		(uuid "f6f857e2-f7a6-479a-b5c2-dac07a49295a")
	)
  (text "CELL: BT1 = EEMB LP401730 Li-po, 150mAh nominal / 140mAh min at 0.2C, 3.7V @ DS p3\nDS = the BARE cell with solder tabs @ DS p4. fitted as a PACK WITH PROTECTION, pack = TBD\npack wires -> BT1 pads, pad 1 = +. NEVER solder to the cell itself @ DS p7\ncharge: 4.200V +-0.020V, max 150mA, ends at 3.0mA, ONLY at 0 to 45C @ DS p3\ndischarge: max 300mA, down to 2.750V +-0.005V, at -20 to 60C @ DS p3\ncharger defaults do NOT fit -> firmware MUST set them (README F1). 4.20V or 4.19V = TBD\ncharger cutoff 3.0V, limit >= 500mA @ BQ25180 DS p34 -> above 300mA only the pack protects"
    (at 20.32 17.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "b969f2fe-6acb-4042-955b-4280eb0e85b6")
  )
  (text "BQ25180YBGR = linear Li-po charger @ I2C 0x6A (DS p24)\ncircuit = DS p41 fig 9-1 + p42 table 9-2. caps AT the balls @ DS p49\nC30 4.7u on IN so > 1uF AFTER derating @ DS p42. 16V, NOT the 25V TI recommends @ DS p42\nC30 + C21 = 9.4u on VBUS, a sink may show max 10u @ USBC spec p153\nC31 10u 25V on SYS, C32 4.7u on BAT = at least 10uF + at least 1uF @ DS p4\n/INT wants a 1k to 20k pullup @ DS p4: NOT fitted, MCU pullup on P0.15 (README F6)\nRT1 10k NTC, B 3380 @ Murata cat p10. chip assumes B 3435 @ SLUAAJ8 p4 = within 1K (calc)\nONLY the NTC on TS/MR, button = MCU pin. NTC ground at the GND ball @ DS p42\nNO reverse polarity part: BAT abs min -0.3V @ DS p5 -> CHECK + before soldering"
    (at 20.32 127 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "ae0c1ce8-cbd2-40f4-be43-487a9d8626b6")
  )
  (text "CHARGER FIRMWARE (DS = BQ25180 DS): the charger wakes with its OWN defaults\nMUST write after EVERY boot, charger reset + USB plug in (README F1):\nTS_HOT = 45C (default 60C @ DS p39), long press OFF (default ship mode @ DS p37),\ncharge settings for the cell (CELL note), SYS 4.5V or 4.4V, NEVER higher (UI sheet)\nNEVER ship mode / hardware reset / SYS_MODE 11: SYS pulled down with 25R @ DS p18\n-> current BACK through U7 + U4 @ LDO DS p19, NO part stops it\nwatchdog resets ALL registers 160s after the last I2C @ DS p20: feed or disable = TBD\nSTORAGE = SYS_MODE 10 = SYS left floating @ DS p17. NEVER shutdown mode (README F2)\nblank MCU = charges at the default 10mA @ DS p32 up to 60C\nhung MCU can NOT be power cycled (sealed) -> MCU watchdog MUST run (README F8)"
    (at 190.5 17.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d8cb0d4a-4c1f-4bac-b855-d0ca8b755a90")
  )
  (text "MAX17048G+T10 = 1 cell fuel gauge @ I2C 0x36 (DS p16)\ncircuit = DS p15 fig 14, C33 100n = \"bypass with 0.1uF\" @ DS p6\nSCL/SDA up to 60pF each @ DS p3 -> bus A at 100kHz, NOT 400\n/ALRT needs a pullup @ DS p14: NOT fitted, MCU pullup on P0.25 (README F6)\nalerts ON by default, /ALRT LOW until firmware clears it @ DS p10 (README F7)\nRCOMP wants the cell temperature @ DS p8: NO sensor at the cell = TBD\nhibernate left automatic: forced is only for loads under C/4 @ DS p9\nSOC accuracy on this cell = NOT stated @ DS p7\nSTORAGE: firmware MUST put it to sleep = 0.5uA typ, 2 max up to 50C @ DS p2 (README F2)"
    (at 177.8 127 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "759a9259-dd24-4ddf-88c5-7f2a773266f6")
  )
